<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate unit plans condominium in Cebu.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate unit plans condominium in Cebu.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fil-Estate Properties Inc, a subsidiary of Fil-Estate Land Inc, entered into an agreement to build several residential condominium units on a 50,644 square metre lot in the central Cebu island, the parent firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>The land is situated adjacent to a resort just outside Cebu city.</p>
<p>The company said the influx of tourists into Cebu could boost demand for residential units.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 84189638 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
